<title>SPAIN: Spain Nov M4 supply rose provisional 6.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain Nov M4 supply rose provisional 6.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following figures:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		    NOV 96     OCT 96     SEP 96</p>
<p> M4 pct rise		     6.6	  12.8	  9.4</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise    4.3	   6.6	 12.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis. October and previous figures were revised.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
